category: Archive
build-depends: cygport libzstd-devel
sdesc: "Compress a file into a seekable zstd with special handling for .tar archives"
ldesc: "t2sz compress a file into a seekable zstd. If the file is a tar archive it
compress each file in the archive into an independent frame, hence the name:
tar 2 seekable zstd."
skip:

homepage: https://github.com/martinellimarco/t2sz
